     CDS             173711..175510
                     /gene="lepA"
                     /locus_tag="WEOB_150"
                     /function="Required for accurate and efficient protein
                     synthesis under certain stress conditions. May act as a
                     fidelity factor of the translation reaction, by catalyzing
                     a one-codon backward translocation of tRNAs on improperly
                     translocated ribosomes. Back-translocation proceeds from a
                     post-translocation (POST) complex to a pre-translocation
                     (PRE) complex, thus giving elongation factor G a second
                     chance to translocate the tRNAs correctly. Binds to
                     ribosomes in a GTP-dependent manner"
